babylon-node-lite
=================

This is a derivative work of the Radix Babylon node (https://github.com/radixdlt/babylon-node),
release v1.4.0.0, Copyright Radix Publishing Ltd, licensed under the Radix License, Version 1.0
(see LICENSE). It adds a "lite validator": a validator that reads the state database of an
existing node on the same host instead of keeping a ledger of its own
(see docs/lite-validator/README.md).

The additions and modifications were made in 2026 by michael-rmp and are distributed under the
same Radix License, Version 1.0. This project is not affiliated with, endorsed by or supported by
RDX Works or the Radix Foundation. "Radix" and "Babylon" are used only to describe the origin of
the work.

